WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

01:50.213 --> 01:55.010
I heard the tofu shop in the third district is moving.

01:55.038 --> 01:55.905
Oh my.

01:55.929 --> 02:00.549
The only shops left around here will be
the produce stand and the cleaners.

02:22.621 --> 02:25.748
Originally "Vibrations" by Tezuka Osamu.

02:22.621 --> 02:25.748
The Shaking Operation Room

02:32.340 --> 02:34.800
Dammit! I can't stand it anymore!

02:35.468 --> 02:38.345
Are you going out again?!

02:38.418 --> 02:39.339
Shut up!

02:39.373 --> 02:40.473
You got a problem with that?

02:40.579 --> 02:41.807
Of course I do!

02:44.269 --> 02:46.103
What?!

02:46.104 --> 02:50.223
If you have the time to worry about money
we don't even know will ever come,

02:50.442 --> 02:53.287
then find a real job instead!

02:54.112 --> 02:56.213
Oh yeah?!

02:56.531 --> 02:59.450
I want to work, but I can't!

03:00.076 --> 03:03.662
Because of the rattling, I can't sleep, I have
.constant migraines, I'm always nauseous,

03:03.663 --> 03:06.579
and on top of that, my hands started shaking recently...

03:07.128 --> 03:09.126
Isn't that just because you drink too much?

03:10.670 --> 03:12.549
No, it's not!

03:13.059 --> 03:15.632
I will get what they owe me.

03:15.633 --> 03:16.734
Hey!

03:21.299 --> 03:22.299
Sheesh.

03:26.229 --> 03:30.682
The local train to Machinaka has arrived at platform two.

03:31.236 --> 03:33.069
It will depart at twenty-six after the top of the hour.

03:33.129 --> 03:35.267
Please wait on board for departure.

03:34.235 --> 03:37.613
Doc, what are we here for today?

03:37.614 --> 03:41.260
I'm collecting the fee for an operation I performed.

03:41.451 --> 03:43.202
They're two months late.

03:45.372 --> 03:49.083
Then let's eat something yummy on the way back.

03:49.084 --> 03:51.502
I want sushi or steak.

03:51.503 --> 03:52.961
We're not here to have fun.

03:53.102 --> 03:55.673
But we're going to get some money, right?

03:55.674 --> 03:57.966
I'll help collect it too.

04:00.428 --> 04:02.763
Well, all right. But only if we do collect it.

04:02.764 --> 04:03.764
Yay!

04:03.807 --> 04:05.307
You promise?

04:08.786 --> 04:09.603
Hey! Hey!

04:09.729 --> 04:13.607
Do you realize what we have to go
through because of you guys?!

04:13.759 --> 04:17.653
As I said before, we are handling the issue as best as we...

04:18.113 --> 04:19.488
Yeah right!

04:19.489 --> 04:22.533
I've been hearing the same thing from you for years now!

04:22.534 --> 04:26.245
All you do is talk! You never do a damn thing!

04:26.246 --> 04:27.913
There's trouble brewing over there.

04:27.914 --> 04:29.790
And it has nothing to do with us.

04:29.806 --> 04:30.518
Let's go.

04:30.542 --> 04:31.875
Yeah right!

04:31.876 --> 04:34.878
But I'm only the station manager.

04:35.797 --> 04:37.047
Please return to your homes.

04:37.048 --> 04:39.133
H-Hey, I'm not done talking...

04:39.153 --> 04:39.661
Hey!

04:40.040 --> 04:41.725
Listen to me!

05:05.718 --> 05:09.731
For personal reasons, we've moved.
Sato

05:14.353 --> 05:16.942
Doc, is this really the place?

05:17.172 --> 05:18.422
Yes, it is.

05:18.547 --> 05:21.340
Memo: "Name: Sato Junichiro"

05:18.594 --> 05:21.969
2-3-18. Just like the memo says.

05:21.413 --> 05:22.966
Asada-cho, 2 - 3 - 18
Junichiro

05:23.845 --> 05:26.158
They moved two weeks ago.

05:27.369 --> 05:29.558
You're here to see Sato-san, right?

05:29.559 --> 05:30.954
Yes, we are..

05:31.144 --> 05:33.049
It was rather sudden too.

05:33.229 --> 05:39.318
They had financial problems, so we're guessing
that they must've skipped town.

05:41.571 --> 05:43.578
Anyway, if you'd excuse me.

05:55.377 --> 05:57.323
Hey, Doc.

06:00.507 --> 06:02.299
Doc!

06:04.678 --> 06:06.296
Doc!

06:08.598 --> 06:11.750
I told you, if the collection didn't...

06:32.264 --> 06:34.971
I said I wanted sushi or steak.

06:35.208 --> 06:36.500
Don't complain.

06:36.501 --> 06:38.085
Be grateful that you can eat.

06:38.120 --> 06:38.808
Also,

06:39.671 --> 06:41.395
this is pretty good.

06:44.175 --> 06:46.719
Really though, this place shakes pretty badly.

06:46.720 --> 06:48.220
This is:nothing.

06:48.692 --> 06:51.181
It gets really bad when an express passes by.

06:51.815 --> 06:52.522
Welcome!

06:54.227 --> 06:55.801
Hey man, give me sake and hot water.

06:56.021 --> 06:57.146
Coming up.

06:59.482 --> 07:01.692
Doc, he's that guy from earlier.

07:01.693 --> 07:02.724
Here you go.

07:03.528 --> 07:05.298
Thanks.

07:06.197 --> 07:09.158
When are you going to pay for the damages?!

07:09.826 --> 07:12.077
You look upset again.

07:12.620 --> 07:14.330
Did you go again today, Hatsan?

07:14.331 --> 07:16.332
Don't call me Hatsan!

07:16.821 --> 07:20.685
I hate that name because it makes me
sound like Hachi-ko from Rakugo.

07:21.004 --> 07:24.757
I have a fine name too: Koizumi Hachiya!

07:34.601 --> 07:37.478
Ohmigewdness!

07:52.494 --> 07:54.286
Dammit.

07:54.287 --> 07:59.625
All they do is spit out some bullshit and
put off the issue until another day!

07:59.809 --> 08:02.685
Take responsibility for it once and for all!

08:03.630 --> 08:04.672
Dammit!

08:04.673 --> 08:07.466
All because of that shaking, we are...

08:08.218 --> 08:10.427
I see. So that's how it is.

08:11.513 --> 08:13.138
That's how what is?

08:13.139 --> 08:13.933
You see,

08:14.307 --> 08:16.058
he's the local mooch,

08:16.059 --> 08:20.938
who's currently trying to get compensation from the
railroad company because of all of this shaking.

08:23.233 --> 08:24.858
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

08:25.360 --> 08:29.863
Where do you get off calling an innocent
citizen, such as myself, a mooch, huh?!

08:30.657 --> 08:32.324
Oh, I'm sorry.

08:32.325 --> 08:35.119
Outsiders would never understand!

08:35.120 --> 08:38.080
It's annoying as hell!

08:38.081 --> 08:39.540
Then move.

08:40.208 --> 08:41.500
Don't give me that crap!

08:41.501 --> 08:45.212
We've lived here since our grandfather's
grandfather's were born!

08:45.213 --> 08:47.464
This is the only home there is for us!

08:47.924 --> 08:49.174
Let me teach you something!

08:49.175 --> 08:50.467
Step on out!

08:53.555 --> 08:54.895
Hey now!

08:55.140 --> 08:57.474
Calm down, Hatsan.

08:57.729 --> 08:59.941
Don't call me Hatsan!

08:58.588 --> 09:00.761
Hey, Hatsan!

09:01.688 --> 09:03.605
Bad news!

09:03.606 --> 09:05.357
Bad news! Bad news!

09:05.358 --> 09:07.484
Really bad news, Hatsan!

09:07.485 --> 09:10.195
Don't call me Hatsan, dammit!

09:10.989 --> 09:13.866
What's the rush, Tsubo-chan?

09:14.494 --> 09:17.119
His wife's in trouble!

09:17.120 --> 09:19.705
She screamed that her stomach hurt and then collapsed!

09:19.706 --> 09:21.999
Nobody can do anything to help her!

09:22.125 --> 09:24.168
Hurry home to her, Hatsan!

09:24.634 --> 09:26.672
Go on, Hatsan!

09:26.758 --> 09:28.422
Don't call me Hatsan!

09:45.523 --> 09:47.524
H-H-H-H-H...

09:47.525 --> 09:49.698
Honey!

09:54.483 --> 09:55.908
Honey!

09:55.909 --> 09:56.533
Daddy!

09:56.534 --> 09:58.243
Mommy's going to die!

10:01.706 --> 10:03.658
H-Honey! Are you all right?

10:03.958 --> 10:05.402
I'll get you a doctor right away!

10:05.877 --> 10:06.627
Honey!

10:06.628 --> 10:08.170
Hang in there, Honey!

10:08.171 --> 10:09.004
Honey!

10:09.275 --> 10:10.022
Stop it!

10:10.135 --> 10:10.708
Don't touch her!

10:29.651 --> 10:31.068
And don't move her.

10:31.069 --> 10:32.423
If you move her now, she'll die.

10:33.044 --> 10:35.447
Hey, you were just...

10:38.260 --> 10:40.410
Are you a doctor?

10:40.651 --> 10:41.651
Yes, I am.

10:41.791 --> 10:42.911
Oh, thank God!

10:43.125 --> 10:44.225
You're a lifesaver!

10:44.606 --> 10:46.246
Hey! A doctor's here!

10:46.386 --> 10:48.210
Hang in there, Honey!

11:01.777 --> 11:03.100
Just as I thought.

11:03.101 --> 11:05.817
She has an aortic dissection in her abdomen.

11:06.271 --> 11:09.481
We'll apply first aid here and then complete
the treatment at a hospital.

11:12.402 --> 11:14.127
Wh-What?

11:14.904 --> 11:17.281
Hey, Hachi, isn't that doctor...

11:17.991 --> 11:21.744
Isn't he that quack called Black something-or-the-other?

11:21.745 --> 11:24.534
I recognized him by the stitches on his face.

11:24.956 --> 11:26.707
You shouldn't let him operate on her.

11:26.708 --> 11:28.751
I heard he asks for about ¥10,000,000.

11:29.210 --> 11:31.295
What did you say?!

11:41.524 --> 11:43.447
¥10,000,000?!

11:45.810 --> 11:47.186
Hold it!

11:47.187 --> 11:50.803
Doctor, sorry, but I don't want any operations.

11:51.107 --> 11:52.650
Now, please leave.

11:52.892 --> 11:54.109
What?

11:54.365 --> 11:57.156
Come on! Go home!

11:57.656 --> 11:58.989
Didn't you hear me?

11:58.990 --> 11:59.865
Stop it!

12:03.411 --> 12:05.579
Why you little... Now you've done it!

12:05.756 --> 12:08.248
If I don't treat her now, it'll be too late!

12:08.249 --> 12:10.209
Shut up!

12:18.510 --> 12:19.853
l'll tell you one more time.

12:20.220 --> 12:22.875
She will die if I don't treat her right now.

12:23.348 --> 12:26.183
I'll never pay ¥10,000,000.

12:26.184 --> 12:27.184
¥10,000,000?

12:27.185 --> 12:30.396
Forget ¥10,000,000. I won't even pay ¥100.

12:31.940 --> 12:33.065
Oh yeah?

12:33.066 --> 12:33.948
I see.

12:35.610 --> 12:37.945
So you're going to let your wife die, huh?

12:40.657 --> 12:42.074
Let's go, Pinoco.

12:43.743 --> 12:44.743
Wait...

12:58.188 --> 12:59.739
W-Wait!

13:00.719 --> 13:02.469
Please save her.

13:05.265 --> 13:06.577
You named the price.

13:06.850 --> 13:09.501
I'll make you pay ¥10,000,000 no matter what it takes.

13:10.019 --> 13:11.019
OK.

13:13.606 --> 13:15.357
Pinoco, prepare for an operation!

13:15.358 --> 13:16.544
Aye-aye!

13:24.075 --> 13:25.643
All right. Let's get started.

13:26.102 --> 13:26.798
Yes.

13:28.637 --> 13:29.375
Scalpel.

13:31.082 --> 13:31.797
Gauze.

13:33.611 --> 13:34.404
Wipe the sweat.

13:36.171 --> 13:36.936
Clamp.

13:38.423 --> 13:39.137
Tube.

13:41.009 --> 13:41.671
Gauze.

13:44.971 --> 13:48.682
D-Doctor, will she be OK?

13:48.683 --> 13:49.725
Don't worry.

13:49.726 --> 13:50.933
The operation is going well.

13:52.437 --> 13:54.438
Now, once the stitching is done...

14:03.572 --> 14:05.949
Wh-What's going on?

14:07.035 --> 14:09.162
It shakes this badly here too?

14:09.871 --> 14:11.611
We're stitching an artery up.

14:11.831 --> 14:15.166
The wound will reopen if it's not done carefully.

14:16.461 --> 14:17.878
I can't operate with this going on!

14:27.510 --> 14:28.704
It stopped.

14:34.437 --> 14:35.729
Again!

14:36.356 --> 14:37.856
What's going on?!

14:39.776 --> 14:43.195
The express train passes this area every
two minutes around this time!

14:43.655 --> 14:44.663
Damn!

15:16.520 --> 15:19.773
If it keeps shaking so often, I can't do anything!

15:20.734 --> 15:21.830
I give up!

15:23.153 --> 15:26.113
Doctor, you can't operate here like this.

15:26.114 --> 15:28.949
We'll carry her to the hospital.

15:28.950 --> 15:31.702
It should be OK if we do it gently.

15:31.925 --> 15:32.605
No!

15:32.912 --> 15:34.371
Do you really think we can move her when she's like this?

15:35.623 --> 15:38.221
But I can't stitch her up like this either.

15:38.543 --> 15:41.464
And if I don't do anything, she
might die from the bleeding.

15:42.380 --> 15:43.547
Somebody, stop those trains!

15:47.469 --> 15:49.678
Hachi! Where are you going?!

15:59.648 --> 16:02.515
Hello, is this Nannansei Railroads?

16:02.817 --> 16:05.861
My name is Koizumi Hachiya.

16:05.862 --> 16:06.862
My wife is...

16:06.863 --> 16:08.266
My wife is in trouble.

16:08.699 --> 16:09.467
Huh?

16:09.491 --> 16:11.950
I told you, it's Hachiya!

16:11.951 --> 16:13.893
Let me talk to the president!

16:14.928 --> 16:15.928
The reason?!

16:16.081 --> 16:17.921
Like I said, my wife...

16:19.501 --> 16:22.544
Hey! Don't hang up on me!

16:24.339 --> 16:26.004
Hey, it's me, Hachiya.

16:26.216 --> 16:27.925
Let me talk to...

16:28.510 --> 16:31.445
I told you, my wife is in...

16:33.973 --> 16:36.283
Hey, my wife is in trouble!

16:39.835 --> 16:41.263
Dammit!

16:44.211 --> 16:46.318
You again?

16:44.211 --> 16:46.319
The Station Manager

16:46.319 --> 16:48.988
Like I've told you many times
already, I can't do anything.

16:48.989 --> 16:49.759
Please!

16:50.306 --> 16:50.800
What's this?

16:50.824 --> 16:53.534
Please don't kill my wife!

16:53.535 --> 16:55.494
Um, excuse me?

16:55.495 --> 16:57.468
She's having an operation done right now.

16:57.747 --> 17:01.458
But because of your trains, it can't continue.

17:03.503 --> 17:04.920
What do you mean?

17:05.110 --> 17:07.045
She got a sudden pain in her stomach.

17:07.298 --> 17:09.550
And it turned out to be something really bad.

17:09.551 --> 17:12.391
A doctor happened to be around, so I thought she'd be OK.

17:12.846 --> 17:17.065
But because those trains pass by so often,
he can't continue with her operation.

17:18.268 --> 17:22.813
We fight all the time, but to me she's irreplaceable.

17:28.028 --> 17:29.320
Please!

17:29.321 --> 17:31.630
Please save her!

17:32.073 --> 17:35.275
We've been together for twenty years.

17:35.869 --> 17:38.069
We finally got kids too.

17:38.371 --> 17:40.551
The youngest is still a toddler.

17:40.832 --> 17:42.833
I'll try harder in the future!

17:43.116 --> 17:45.085
Please, Manager!

17:45.086 --> 17:46.545
Please stop the trains!

17:47.881 --> 17:49.506
Even if it's only for a moment!

17:50.550 --> 17:51.743
Please!

17:52.093 --> 17:54.251
Please don't let my wife die!

17:54.471 --> 17:57.337
Please, Manager!

17:58.975 --> 18:00.042
All right.

18:00.226 --> 18:02.478
I can't guarantee I can do it, but...

18:08.443 --> 18:10.616
Before the next train vomes...

18:11.446 --> 18:14.406
Damn. If I could just have fifteen minutes...

18:15.700 --> 18:19.370
The next express strain will be here any moment now.

18:21.665 --> 18:23.666
If it comes now, she'll be done for.

18:27.754 --> 18:29.713
Doctor, it's coming!

18:30.715 --> 18:32.883
Please, don't come!

18:35.970 --> 18:36.929
Huh?

18:56.542 --> 19:00.255
Attention please, Ladies and Gentlemen.

19:01.622 --> 19:05.929
A medical operation is currently
being done in a house nearby.

19:06.562 --> 19:08.522
It's a life-and-death situation,

19:08.591 --> 19:14.152
and the shaking and noise from the train
may be disrupting the operation.

19:14.271 --> 19:20.838
Consequently, we have decided to temporarily cease
running to avoid disturbing them for a while.

19:21.352 --> 19:26.905
We sincerly apologize for any
inconvenience this may cause.

19:27.045 --> 19:28.085
This is bull.

19:28.412 --> 19:29.351
I'm in a hurry!

19:30.233 --> 19:32.648
It's always the passengers who lose out!

19:32.944 --> 19:34.820
Why is it...

19:39.034 --> 19:41.368
Well, I guess it's better than a strike.

19:58.011 --> 19:59.127
Honey...

20:04.601 --> 20:06.226
Hey, Hatsan!

20:06.271 --> 20:07.918
What are you doing?!

20:06.565 --> 20:07.292
Hey! Let me go!

20:07.292 --> 20:08.959
I'm not Hatsan!

20:09.154 --> 20:11.614
Hey! What's the matter with you?!

20:11.639 --> 20:12.639
Geez!

20:12.145 --> 20:14.058
Think it over, Hatsan!

20:14.194 --> 20:15.694
She's alive!

20:15.695 --> 20:17.613
The operation was a success!

20:20.450 --> 20:21.450
What did you say?

20:27.510 --> 20:28.510
Honey!

20:30.183 --> 20:31.183
Dear...

20:32.170 --> 20:34.880
Its because of Dr. Black Jack.

20:39.260 --> 20:40.373
Doctor...

20:41.197 --> 20:42.870
Did you stop the trains?

20:49.145 --> 20:50.523
The operation was successful.

20:50.939 --> 20:52.481
Now, pay the fee.

20:53.692 --> 20:54.614
I know.

20:54.818 --> 20:55.859
It's just...

20:55.860 --> 20:59.907
Doctor, I'm sorry, but would you just take this for today?

21:03.029 --> 21:03.802
What's this?

21:04.536 --> 21:09.248
We'll pay the rest little by little
when we can. We promise

21:09.323 --> 21:10.205
Sen-san...

21:10.229 --> 21:12.292
Please!

21:13.124 --> 21:14.294
E-E...

21:15.130 --> 21:16.463
Everyone...

21:16.654 --> 21:19.425
We help each other when we're in trouble, right, Hatsan?

21:19.555 --> 21:20.843
I'm not Hat...

21:26.641 --> 21:28.224
I guess Hatsan is fine.

21:31.146 --> 21:33.463
Thanks everyone.

21:43.116 --> 21:45.576
Hey, Doc.

21:45.577 --> 21:47.038
Yeah. I know.

21:47.704 --> 21:49.376
Does that mean...

21:49.664 --> 21:52.082
Yeah. I'll take you out for a big dinner.

21:52.083 --> 21:54.626
Yay! Steak!

21:54.627 --> 21:56.846
I want to go to a quiet place.

21:57.172 --> 22:00.591
I've had enough shaking and noise for one day.

22:01.718 --> 22:05.123
I want an omelette and curry and...

22:10.545 --> 22:17.551
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.545 --> 22:17.551
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.552 --> 22:24.724
Only look straight at me.

22:17.552 --> 22:24.724
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.769 --> 22:32.026
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.769 --> 22:32.026
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.027 --> 22:42.536
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.027 --> 22:42.536
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.537 --> 22:47.917
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.537 --> 22:47.917
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.918 --> 22:57.301
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.918 --> 22:53.123
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.578 --> 22:57.302
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.302 --> 23:08.062
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.302 --> 23:08.062
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.063 --> 23:13.150
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.063 --> 23:13.150
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.151 --> 23:26.121
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.151 --> 23:26.121
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.122 --> 23:33.045
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.122 --> 23:33.045
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.046 --> 23:43.931
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.046 --> 23:36.979
sora no hate tooku

23:37.072 --> 23:43.872
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.089 --> 24:14.973
Hospital Jack

23:45.575 --> 23:47.208
Out! Of! My! Way!

23:47.349 --> 23:49.016
We're taking over this hospital.

23:49.249 --> 23:51.516
Everyone in this hospital is our hostage.

23:51.789 --> 23:54.338
Prepare ¥1,000,000,000 for the ransom.

23:55.417 --> 23:56.670
Destroy the power supply?!

23:56.817 --> 23:59.985
If they do that, some patients will die!

24:00.103 --> 24:02.163
I've ordered all operations to halt.

24:02.188 --> 24:04.262
Until they resume, the patients' incisions will remain open.

24:04.322 --> 24:06.449
It's as if you're seeking revenge!

24:06.528 --> 24:07.728
I have no time.

24:07.843 --> 24:08.870
Why do you...

24:08.910 --> 24:10.447
Because I'm a doctor.

24:10.533 --> 24:11.860
Force your way in!

24:12.366 --> 24:14.579
Next Karte - Hospital Jack.

24:16.360 --> 24:18.198
Karte NG...

24:19.453 --> 24:20.951
It stopped...
